  dialogueLines:
  - Hiyah, youngin! A nice day for some fishing, huh? Say, what kind of a rod is
    that?
  - Oh, it's not a rod at all, but a metal detector? Say that gives me an idea...
  - I was casting my facorite lure, but snagged it on something in the sand! I lost
    it there and then.
  - Use your detector there and see if you can't find my lure. There'll be a Star
    in it for ya!
  searchingDialogueLines:
  - Haven't have much luck without my lucky lure...
  - Any luck finding it?
  turnInDialogueLines:
  - Wow! You're a master detector! Can't believe you found it.
  - Now I can finally get on catching again. Here's the Star I promised ya!
  completedDialogueLines:
  - Fish be bitin' now for sure!
